      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 📌 PZM-03 — Offline Order Intake [Demo]\n\n**Owned By:** [Nama kamu / Pisza Mako]\n**Last Updated:** 2026-09-02\n\n**Description:**\nTerima order dari frontend (form order offline/GoFood di Vercel) lewat webhook,\nlalu simpan ke Auto-Order + upsert CRM - pakai logic yang sama seperti PZM-01,\nsupaya order non-WA tetap konsisten update CRM.\n\n**Flow Steps:**\n1. Terima webhook dari frontend (POST)\n2. Normalisasi nomor HP (kalau ada)\n3. Simpan ke Auto-Order + upsert CRM (paralel)\n4. Balas OK ke frontend\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- Credential: Google Sheets OAuth2\n- Global Error Workflow: ErrorHandler [Global]\n- Dipanggil oleh: frontend Next.js, endpoint /api/order-offline (lihat N8N_ORDER_WEBHOOK_URL di .env)\n",
        "height": 628,
        "width": 608
      },
